WEBVTT

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.520
Ten pieces of goblin rune stone 
and and 20 medicinal herbs.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.750
Okay! Looks like it's all here.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.540
You've passed the trial! Congratulations.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.500
The Horizon Adventurer's Guild 
hereby recognizes Rein Shroud

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.430
as an F-Rank Adventurer.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.820
Here is your adventurer's card.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.800
It's your identification from now on, 
so take good care of it.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.710
Right. Thank you.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.050
And this is your reward. Fifty copper coins.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.760
It was an F-rank job, 
so it's not much, but...

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.500
Still, as your rank goes up, 
you'll be paid even more,

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.670
and given how quickly you passed the trial,

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:45.070
I'm sure you'll be promoted in no time!

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:46.600
Good luck!

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.390
Thanks.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.890
<i>If I'm going to work on increasing my rank, 
I'll want lodgings to operate out of...</i>

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.740
<i>But the amount I just 
got paid won't cover it.</i>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.700
<i>Okay!</i>

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Rein!

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.850
Sorry about the wait, Kanade.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.250
Welcome back!

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:07.080
So, are you an adventurer now?! Huh?!

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.530
Yep, I sure am.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.000
Really?! Congratulations!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.050
Thanks.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:15.550
I actually wanted to start accepting jobs...

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:16.880
Is that okay with you, Kanade?

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.900
Yep! No problems here! Let's go!

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.430
Well, hell, you don't see this every day.

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:30.980
A bona-fide Cat Spirit.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.290
Comrades

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.400
Do you need something?

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.650
Never seen a real one in person.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.750
What's a Cat Spirit like you 
doing in a place like this?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.960
I've got nothing to say to you, buster!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.560
Aw, no need to be cold.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.290
How about we have some drinks?

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.260
It's bound to be more fun than hanging 
out with this boring looking brat.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.970
Hey!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.680
Don't you mock my master!

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.890
Rein tamed me, got it?!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.810
Huh? Tamed...?

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.940
I'm a Beast Tamer.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.680
Don't be stupid, kid!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.340
Cat Spirits are one of the ultimate species.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:45.240
How's a runt like this 
supposed to tame one?

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.620
That just goes to show 
how bad a judge you are.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:53.300
Rein is an amazing Beast Tamer, 
and way stronger than you!

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.400
Kanade...

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.760
So this shrimp's supposed to 
be stronger than me?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.340
In that case...

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:07.050
Let's see who's really stronger 
between you and me.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.870
And the girl will be the prize.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.540
Kanade...?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.140
You're not gonna chicken out, are you?

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:18.020
Not when you're the kinda mighty Beast 
Tamer that can tame a Cat Spirit...

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.000
Someone like me shouldn't be 
much of a challenge at all.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.920
<i>I don't care what he says about me,</i>

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:29.790
<i>but if I avoid this, he's likely to come 
after Kanade again in the future.</i>

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.120
Rein!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.170
Found your nerve, huh?

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.190
<i>She'd be in danger.</i>

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.170
<i>I can't let that happen!</i>

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.140
Don't cry if I end up snapping 
your twig of an arm.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.390
There's a rare Cat Spirit on the line.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.600
Maybe my luck's turning around.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:56.770
<i>Even if it's futile... 
I have to do whatever I can!</i>

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.520
Ready... go!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.810
Rein wins!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.040
Ow...!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.470
Okay, what's all the commotion?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.620
You again?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.580
My apologies, Rein.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.990
The guild's actually 
been aware of his antics,

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.970
It hurts so bad! What the hell?!

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.440
You stupid brat! Stupid... brat!

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:24.430
and has been considering 
suspending his license...

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:32.310
You have our sincere apologies. 
I can take it from here.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.290
O-Okay.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.120
I must ask, Rein...

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:41.140
How did you end up contracted 
with an ultimate species

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.570
during the course of your trial?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.360
That came as a much bigger surprise to me!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.450
S-Sorry...

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.570
My apologies! My inner voice was leaking out.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.810
Well, since you were able to 
find such a powerful partner,

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.830
I'm sure we can expect 
great things from you!

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.430
Until then!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.760
How'd I do that?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.730
I shouldn't be so strong.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.680
Did you not notice, Rein?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:16.320
When you're contracted with 
a powerful species like mine,

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:20.270
it amplifies your own strength, 
as the master, as a result.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:25.230
Which means right now, you're about 
as strong as a Cat Spirit, Rein!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.570
I'm strong like you now?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.770
That's like something out of a dream.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.530
You honestly had no idea?

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.880
No.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:39.550
I mean, no one back home ever contracted 
with someone from an ultimate species, so...

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:41.700
And I was just desperate, back there.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.250
Oh, I see!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:49.630
Well, I was super happy 
when you protected me like that!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.680
I mean... why wouldn't I be?

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:56.710
Okay! It's about time we get to that job!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.350
I'm gonna work hard!

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:01.190
Or so I thought, but...

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.510
Why? Why this?

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:06.150
Why more herb gathering?

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.280
You are an adventurer, right?!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.200
Shouldn't you be looking 
for a legendary sword,

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.710
or rescuing kidnapped princesses?!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.550
How about a job like that?!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.450
I'm still at the bottom with an F-rank. 
That means only basic jobs.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.290
We'll just have to handle jobs like this 
until we've got more experience...

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.460
Okay, then. I understand.

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.500
I'm gonna work hard! 
And yank all this grass out!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.540
Okay, good job finding them.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.390
Thanks. This should cover our quota!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.270
Again with this?!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.170
It's no fair!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:46.610
I'm your familiar, so I want to help you.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.780
Where do a bunch of temps 
get off hogging all the credit?!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.740
Well, we got the amount we needed, 
so let's report back to the guild.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.200
Wait!

00:07:58.590 --> 00:07:59.720
Kanade?

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.540
Something's happening over there.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.290
I can hear yelling and...

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.000
Screams, I think?

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.140
Let's check it out!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.340
Looks like your guards all 
left you hanging, gramps!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:18.480
They took off the second they 
realized we were the Ebon Fangs.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.810
How's it feel? Huh?

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:23.770
Having the adventurers you 
hired abandon you like this?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.480
The Ebon Fangs?

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.320
I heard about them while I was traveling.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.340
They're a major band of brigands, 
with over a hundred members!

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.340
They have a reputation all over 
for the things they do,

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.530
and the things they do are really awful!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.350
This is dangerous. Let's go get help.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:42.580
No. I don't think we'll have enough time.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.580
Please, spare my life!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:47.090
"Hey, as long as you drop your wares, 
we couldn't care less about you."

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:50.080
Did you really think it'd be that easy?!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.360
P-Please, no!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.050
We have to stop this.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.680
I want to save him.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.850
That's my master for you!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.560
I'll jump in among them.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.310
You protect the old man, Kanade.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:11.780
Got it!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.090
Here we go...

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.650
What the...?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.840
Mister, are you okay?

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:23.890
Y-Yes...

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:24.580
This way!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:25.930
Who's this brat?!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.620
Slaughter him!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:33.020
<i>To be absolutely honest, I was nervous.</i>

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:38.260
<i>Rein has the kind of potential 
to redefine what a Beast Tamer is.</i>

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:42.840
<i>And on top of that, he's gained the power 
of a Cat Spirit through our contract.</i>

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:48.160
<i>I would never think forming 
this contract was a mistake.</i>

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:54.850
<i>But... what if he has trouble 
adapting to his newfound strength?</i>

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:58.320
<i>Would it negatively affect his mind?</i>

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.660
<i>Could it cause him to self-destruct?</i>

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.550
<i>I know what his orders were,</i>

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:08.370
<i>but I think it'd be safer if I was 
the one fighting on the front lines.</i>

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:19.500
Wow...

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:24.190
<i>It's like I was worried for nothing.</i>

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:32.070
<i>I can't look away from Rein as he fights.</i>

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.800
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:39.970
<i>My heart is pounding!</i>

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.310
That ought to do it.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.780
Kanade, everything okay on your end?

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:53.610
Yep! He doesn't seem hurt at all.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.190
Well, that's good to hear.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.970
You're bright red! Were you hurt somehow?

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.280
No, no! This is nothing!

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.810
M-More importantly, Rein, that was amazing!

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.810
You did all that, without any weapons!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:11.020
Well, to make sure we don't hurt the animals 
we're trying to tame with weapons,

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.270
we were taught martial arts.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.230
Wow, is that right?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.950
Excuse me, but the two of you 
really did save me from grave danger.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.160
Oh, we're just glad you're okay.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:26.410
But isn't a merchant traveling 
without guards a little dangerous?

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.460
Actually, I had hired some, but...

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.750
They took off the second things 
took a turn for the worse.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.670
They sound terrible.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.490
They're of no concern, now.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:39.050
I'm more worried about reprisals 
from the Ebon Fangs

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.940
when they find out their men 
have been beaten...

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:43.780
You need to escape!

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:47.420
Everyone who has defied 
them has been killed!

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:49.680
They're really that dangerous?

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:53.940
I guess we should capture them all, then.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.190
Uh, Rein?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.160
Hey, are you serious about doing this?

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:05.850
If they're as violent and vindictive 
as they sound, we could run,

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.480
but that merchant and the people 
and town might end up in danger.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.580
I can't just let that happen.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.180
But we're talking about 
over a hundred bandits...

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:17.910
Isn't that biting off a bit much?

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:19.550
Not exactly.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.530
I've actually got a plan.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.430
Looks like that's their hideout.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.940
Thanks for the tip.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.640
As for what we're gonna do... Kanade?

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.890
I wanted to find the hideout!

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:40.860
But an animal beat me to it again!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:45.570
I'm supposed to be Rein's familiar, 
but I've been totally useless!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.910
C-Come on, that's not true!

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.530
Oh, hey, ants...

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.830
Really, Kanade, you've been a huge help.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.460
I'm just goofing around.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.080
So, Rein, what's this plan you have?

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.760
Well, it involves the temporary contract...

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.040
That I made with this guy.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:03.800
A bee?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:08.150
These are actually called Ahrbees, 
and they're a little special.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:12.020
They've got a paralytic sting that will put 
anyone who's hit by it down for 12 hours.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.730
Wow! Wait...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:19.560
Aren't bees insects? 
How can you tame them?

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:23.150
Oh, that. Have you heard of Insect Tamers?

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.110
Insect...?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.430
They're a sub-class of Beast 
Tamer that tames bugs.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:33.410
I went through the training 
back home for a while.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.580
I haven't quite mastered it, but...

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:41.070
That's still amazing! Having the
 skills from two classes?

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:44.300
The surprises never end with Rein.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.550
You think so?

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:49.760
Anyway, I'm going to send 
the bees after the bandits.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.340
I want you to run to town 
and get some reinforcements.

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.490
Roger! Wait...

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:56.620
Shh!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:02.540
Rein, you keep doing all 
the dangerous parts yourself.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:06.320
Am I really any help as a familiar?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.660
Kanade, like I said before...

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.190
It's fine! I just wanted to say it.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.620
But what reinforcements do you mean?

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:17.360
Well, arresting a hundred bandits 
will require extra hands,

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.830
so I want you to bring adventurers 
and the order of knights.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.180
The order of knights?

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:25.400
They're tasked by the government 
with upholding the peace across the land.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.300
Since we're dealing with bandits, 
they're bound to come running.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.150
Okay, got it!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.730
But, just be careful, okay?

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.270
Knowing you, it'll be fine, but...

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.730
I'll run away if it gets dangerous. I promise.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:42.440
Okay! I'll be right back 
with that help, then.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.230
Looks like he brought his friends.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.040
Okay, here we go...

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.380
Did they follow us?!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.220
It seems... we managed to escape.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:12.180
What a nightmare.

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.080
I thought it'd be a good way 
to kill some time

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.280
and earn some coin until 
we took on the Lost Woods.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.980
And it should have been an easy job!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:25.410
I can't believe we had to run 
from a bunch of scumbag bandits!

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:32.860
We would've been better off schmoozing it up 
with Arios and Aggath instead.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:37.430
You were the one who said 
that seemed "like a drag," Leane.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.730
Because it would be.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.720
I don't know why the Hero's 
party is expected

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:45.060
to suck up to anyone 
who isn't royalty, anyway.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.550
But right now, more than any of that...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.600
I've got a bone to pick with you!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:56.390
Isn't buying time for spell casters 
in the rear the most basic of basics?!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.100
Where do you get off 
running away like that?!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.480
True enough.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:04.710
I'm amazed you accepted this job, 
even temporarily, considering...

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.030
Look, I already told you!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:10.850
I'm a Beast Tamer, 
and not cut out for combat!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.700
Are you trying to put this on us?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.970
Even someone as useless as Rein 
could fight on the front lines...

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.160
I d-don't even know who that is!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:24.290
Then why weren't you more 
thorough in scouting out the area?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:29.590
Did you honestly think a single squirrel 
was enough to gain the lay of the land?

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:33.550
Yeah! You should've just 
tamed ten or twenty.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.680
Where do you get off slacking, 
you taming trash?!

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.180
What are you even talking about?

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.020
That's not even possible!

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:45.110
Forget ten. Most people 
can't even tame two at once!

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:50.280
Fundamentally, a single Beast Tamer 
tames a single beast at a time!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.700
If you tried to tame 
more than one at once,

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.030
it'd be enough to burn out 
your nervous system!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.850
And you two have been making 
all these crazy demands

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.630
when you don't even know that?!

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.540
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:10.420
<i>What does that say about him, taming dozens of animals at once so easily?</i>

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:14.050
Okay, fine.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.140
It's clear you're useless, and a liar.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:18.850
Well...

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:22.850
We can hardly have people learning

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.240
that members of the Hero's 
party screwed up like this.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.440
Which is why you're going to 
take responsibility for accepting

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.500
and failing this job on your own.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.520
Got it?

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.860
B-But my reputation will be...

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.420
I have over a thousand spells.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:42.370
Mina has healing magic 
that can even raise the dead.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:47.570
Maybe you'd be more cooperative after dying 
and being resurrected a few times...?

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:49.120
O-Okay!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.560
Fine then!

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.600
This has been a huge waste of time.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.080
Truly.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.150
And all of that nonsense he spoke...

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.590
He was making it sound as if Rein was—

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.370
Dealing with this garbage has me exhausted!

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.960
Let's get back already.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:08.060
I suppose so. Arios and Aggath 
should be nearly done.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.110
<i>Wasting our time with those stupid lies...</i>

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.010
<i>That piece of trash, Rein?</i>

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.070
<i>There's no way he's actually 
any good at anything.</i>

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.400
Whole body's numb...

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.370
Can't move...

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.440
Looks like that went smoothly.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.870
Good work! And thanks.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:32.820
Rein! I got help!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.840
The little lady filled us in on the details.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.430
I'm impressed you were able 
to deal with the Ebon Fangs.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:42.240
Then again, you were already 
impressive back at the guild.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:44.970
Well, you can leave the cleanup to us!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.920
Thanks. That'd be a huge help.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.360
Actually, I only see adventurers.

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.940
The knights aren't coming.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.780
"We've no time to deal with 
mere cutpurses," apparently.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.950
You two should let us take it from here. 
You already took care of the hard part.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.580
Thanks for calling them so quickly.

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:08.850
You're probably tired, huh?

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.830
Nah, I'm fine!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.040
I'm glad I was able to help you, Rein!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.820
Yeah. And now it looks 
like this is taken care—

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.370
What is that sound?!

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.940
Rein... this is bad, I think those are...

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.830
No way! King Lizards?!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.320
What's the equivalent 
of C-ranked monsters doing here?!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.590
We were keeping them around 
for just this kind of occasion!

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.540
Hey! Go ahead and wipe them—

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:55.520
This is no good, they're going berserk!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.090
Rein!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.170
Yeah!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.510
He was able to hurt a King Lizard?!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.970
There's more where that came from!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.070
Damn...

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.730
Take the bandits and get clear of the cave!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.480
B-But we can't just...

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:21.190
It's okay! We'll handle it.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.150
Okay.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.470
Everybody, move!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.000
Don't you dare die!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.270
This way! Quickly!

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.060
We'll see you later!

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.460
<i>I wonder what the old me would have done?</i>

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.060
<i>The person who traveled with Arios' party</i>

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.420
<i>would've probably realized 
he couldn't do anything.</i>

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.220
<i>But things are different now.</i>

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.430
<i>Kanade is with me.</i>

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.680
<i>And with her...</i>

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:06.570
It's been a while since we left the cave.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.770
Yeah.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:12.070
Taking on that many King Lizards... 
You've gotta imagine they're...

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.980
You're amazing, buddy!

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.030
You too, miss!

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.530
She really is an ultimate species!

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:28.680
Hooray!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.300
This is incredible!

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.180
<i>Everyone's acknowledging me.</i>

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:37.230
<i>Me, the person who was kicked out 
of the Hero's party for being useless.</i>

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:46.060
<i>Her being an ultimate species or my familiar...</i>

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:48.440
<i>Those things don't really matter.</i>

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.700
Thank you, Kanade.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:57.960
With you by my side, 
I get the feeling I can do anything!

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:00.540
Rein...

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:02.810
Yeah!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:39.980
Another Ultimate Species

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:39.390
Next Time: "Another Ultimate Species."
